    "// 이렇게 했다 - 되돌릴 수 없는 액션이 가장 누르기 쉬운 자리에\nToolbarItem(placement: .bottomBar) {\n    Button(\"삭제\", systemImage: \"trash\", role: .destructive) { delete() }\n}\n\n// 이렇게 고쳤다 - 하단은 고빈도 액션, 삭제는 대상 위에서 한 단계 거쳐\nToolbarItem(placement: .bottomBar) {\n    Button(\"새 메일\", systemImage: \"square.and.pencil\") { compose() }\n}\n.swipeActions { Button(\"삭제\", role: .destructive) { … } }": {
      "comment": "On-screen SwiftUI code sample. Translate only Korean comments and string literals; keep Swift code as is.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// Before - an irreversible action in the easiest spot to tap\nToolbarItem(placement: .bottomBar) {\n    Button(\"Delete\", systemImage: \"trash\", role: .destructive) { delete() }\n}\n\n// After - the bottom holds high-frequency actions; delete happens on the target, one step removed\nToolbarItem(placement: .bottomBar) {\n    Button(\"New Message\", systemImage: \"square.and.pencil\") { compose() }\n}\n.swipeActions { Button(\"Delete\", role: .destructive) { … } }"
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// Before - an irreversible action in the easiest spot to tap\nToolbarItem(placement: .bottomBar) {\n    Button(\"Delete\", systemImage: \"trash\", role: .destructive) { delete() }\n}\n\n// After - the bottom holds high-frequency actions; delete happens on the target, one step removed\nToolbarItem(placement: .bottomBar) {\n    Button(\"New Message\", systemImage: \"square.and.pencil\") { compose() }\n}\n.swipeActions { Button(\"Delete\", role: .destructive) { … } }"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// 修正前 - 取り消せないアクションをいちばん押しやすい場所に\nToolbarItem(placement: .bottomBar) {\n    Button(\"削除\", systemImage: \"trash\", role: .destructive) { delete() }\n}\n\n// 修正後 - 下部は高頻度のアクション、削除は対象の上で一段階挟んで\nToolbarItem(placement: .bottomBar) {\n    Button(\"新規メッセージ\", systemImage: \"square.and.pencil\") { compose() }\n}\n.swipeActions { Button(\"削除\", role: .destructive) { … } }"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// 이렇게 했다 - 되돌릴 수 없는 액션이 가장 누르기 쉬운 자리에\nToolbarItem(placement: .bottomBar) {\n    Button(\"삭제\", systemImage: \"trash\", role: .destructive) { delete() }\n}\n\n// 이렇게 고쳤다 - 하단은 고빈도 액션, 삭제는 대상 위에서 한 단계 거쳐\nToolbarItem(placement: .bottomBar) {\n    Button(\"새 메일\", systemImage: \"square.and.pencil\") { compose() }\n}\n.swipeActions { Button(\"삭제\", role: .destructive) { … } }"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// 原来的做法：无法撤销的操作放在最容易点到的位置\nToolbarItem(placement: .bottomBar) {\n    Button(\"删除\", systemImage: \"trash\", role: .destructive) { delete() }\n}\n\n// 改后的做法：底部放高频操作，删除放在对象上，多一步再执行\nToolbarItem(placement: .bottomBar) {\n    Button(\"写邮件\", systemImage: \"square.and.pencil\") { compose() }\n}\n.swipeActions { Button(\"删除\", role: .destructive) { … } }"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// 原來的做法：無法撤銷的操作放在最容易點到的位置\nToolbarItem(placement: .bottomBar) {\n    Button(\"刪除\", systemImage: \"trash\", role: .destructive) { delete() }\n}\n\n// 改後的做法：底部放高頻操作，刪除放在物件上，多一步再執行\nToolbarItem(placement: .bottomBar) {\n    Button(\"寫郵件\", systemImage: \"square.and.pencil\") { compose() }\n}\n.swipeActions { Button(\"刪除\", role: .destructive) { … } }"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// Как сделали: необратимое действие там, куда проще всего нажать\nToolbarItem(placement: .bottomBar) {\n    Button(\"Удалить\", systemImage: \"trash\", role: .destructive) { delete() }\n}\n\n// Как исправили: внизу частые действия, а удаление на объекте, через дополнительный шаг\nToolbarItem(placement: .bottomBar) {\n    Button(\"Новое письмо\", systemImage: \"square.and.pencil\") { compose() }\n}\n.swipeActions { Button(\"Удалить\", role: .destructive) { … } }"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// Antes: una acción irreversible en el sitio más fácil de tocar\nToolbarItem(placement: .bottomBar) {\n    Button(\"Eliminar\", systemImage: \"trash\", role: .destructive) { delete() }\n}\n\n// Después: abajo van las acciones de alta frecuencia; eliminar se hace sobre el objetivo, un paso más lejos\nToolbarItem(placement: .bottomBar) {\n    Button(\"Nuevo mensaje\", systemImage: \"square.and.pencil\") { compose() }\n}\n.swipeActions { Button(\"Eliminar\", role: .destructive) { … } }"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// Vorher: eine nicht umkehrbare Aktion an der am leichtesten antippbaren Stelle\nToolbarItem(placement: .bottomBar) {\n    Button(\"Löschen\", systemImage: \"trash\", role: .destructive) { delete() }\n}\n\n// Nachher: unten liegen häufige Aktionen; Löschen geschieht am Ziel, einen Schritt entfernt\nToolbarItem(placement: .bottomBar) {\n    Button(\"Neue Nachricht\", systemImage: \"square.and.pencil\") { compose() }\n}\n.swipeActions { Button(\"Löschen\", role: .destructive) { … } }"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// Avant : une action irréversible à l'endroit le plus facile à toucher\nToolbarItem(placement: .bottomBar) {\n    Button(\"Supprimer\", systemImage: \"trash\", role: .destructive) { delete() }\n}\n\n// Après : le bas accueille les actions à haute fréquence ; la suppression se fait sur la cible, un cran plus loin\nToolbarItem(placement: .bottomBar) {\n    Button(\"Nouveau message\", systemImage: \"square.and.pencil\") { compose() }\n}\n.swipeActions { Button(\"Supprimer\", role: .destructive) { … } }"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// Prima: un'azione irreversibile nel punto più facile da toccare\nToolbarItem(placement: .bottomBar) {\n    Button(\"Elimina\", systemImage: \"trash\", role: .destructive) { delete() }\n}\n\n// Dopo: la parte bassa ospita azioni ad alta frequenza; l'eliminazione avviene sul bersaglio, un passo più in là\nToolbarItem(placement: .bottomBar) {\n    Button(\"Nuovo messaggio\", systemImage: \"square.and.pencil\") { compose() }\n}\n.swipeActions { Button(\"Elimina\", role: .destructive) { … } }"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "// 이렇게 했다 - 두 장치를 겹쳐 걸었다\nText(address).lineLimit(1).minimumScaleFactor(0.4)\n\n// 이렇게 고쳤다 - 줄 수로 다루고, 넘치면 볼 경로를 준다\nText(address).lineLimit(2...3)": {
      "comment": "On-screen SwiftUI code sample. Translate only Korean comments and string literals; keep Swift code as is.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// Before - two mechanisms stacked on top of each other\nText(address).lineLimit(1).minimumScaleFactor(0.4)\n\n// After - handle it with line count, and give a path to see the overflow\nText(address).lineLimit(2...3)"
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// Before - two mechanisms stacked on top of each other\nText(address).lineLimit(1).minimumScaleFactor(0.4)\n\n// After - handle it with line count, and give a path to see the overflow\nText(address).lineLimit(2...3)"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// 修正前 - 2つの仕組みを重ねてかけた\nText(address).lineLimit(1).minimumScaleFactor(0.4)\n\n// 修正後 - 行数で扱い、あふれたら見る手段を用意する\nText(address).lineLimit(2...3)"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// 이렇게 했다 - 두 장치를 겹쳐 걸었다\nText(address).lineLimit(1).minimumScaleFactor(0.4)\n\n// 이렇게 고쳤다 - 줄 수로 다루고, 넘치면 볼 경로를 준다\nText(address).lineLimit(2...3)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// 原来的做法：两种机制叠在一起\nText(address).lineLimit(1).minimumScaleFactor(0.4)\n\n// 改后的做法：按行数处理，放不下就给出查看全文的路径\nText(address).lineLimit(2...3)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// 原來的做法：兩種機制疊在一起\nText(address).lineLimit(1).minimumScaleFactor(0.4)\n\n// 改後的做法：按行數處理，放不下就給出檢視全文的路徑\nText(address).lineLimit(2...3)"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// Как сделали: два механизма наложены друг на друга\nText(address).lineLimit(1).minimumScaleFactor(0.4)\n\n// Как исправили: работаем со строками и даём путь посмотреть переполнение\nText(address).lineLimit(2...3)"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// Antes: dos mecanismos apilados\nText(address).lineLimit(1).minimumScaleFactor(0.4)\n\n// Después: resuélvelo con el número de líneas y ofrece un camino para ver lo que desborda\nText(address).lineLimit(2...3)"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// Vorher: zwei Mechanismen übereinandergestapelt\nText(address).lineLimit(1).minimumScaleFactor(0.4)\n\n// Nachher: mit der Zeilenzahl lösen und einen Weg bieten, den Überlauf zu sehen\nText(address).lineLimit(2...3)"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// Avant : deux mécanismes empilés l'un sur l'autre\nText(address).lineLimit(1).minimumScaleFactor(0.4)\n\n// Après : gérez-le avec le nombre de lignes et donnez un chemin pour voir le débordement\nText(address).lineLimit(2...3)"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// Prima: due meccanismi sovrapposti l'uno all'altro\nText(address).lineLimit(1).minimumScaleFactor(0.4)\n\n// Dopo: gestiscilo con il numero di righe e offri un percorso per vedere il resto\nText(address).lineLimit(2...3)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "// 이렇게 했다 - 상시 부착\nTab(\"소식\", systemImage: \"bell\") { … }.badge(1)\n\n// 이렇게 고쳤다 - 남은 것의 수. 0이면 시스템이 알아서 감춘다\nTab(\"소식\", systemImage: \"bell\") { … }.badge(unread.count)": {
      "comment": "On-screen SwiftUI code sample. Translate only Korean comments and string literals; keep Swift code as is.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// Before: always attached\nTab(\"Updates\", systemImage: \"bell\") { … }.badge(1)\n\n// After: the count of what's left. At 0 the system hides it for you\nTab(\"Updates\", systemImage: \"bell\") { … }.badge(unread.count)"
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// Before: always attached\nTab(\"Updates\", systemImage: \"bell\") { … }.badge(1)\n\n// After: the count of what's left. At 0 the system hides it for you\nTab(\"Updates\", systemImage: \"bell\") { … }.badge(unread.count)"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// こうしていた: 常に付けっぱなし\nTab(\"お知らせ\", systemImage: \"bell\") { … }.badge(1)\n\n// こう直した: 残りの件数。0ならシステムが自動で隠す\nTab(\"お知らせ\", systemImage: \"bell\") { … }.badge(unread.count)"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// 이렇게 했다 - 상시 부착\nTab(\"소식\", systemImage: \"bell\") { … }.badge(1)\n\n// 이렇게 고쳤다 - 남은 것의 수. 0이면 시스템이 알아서 감춘다\nTab(\"소식\", systemImage: \"bell\") { … }.badge(unread.count)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// 原来的做法：一直挂着\nTab(\"动态\", systemImage: \"bell\") { … }.badge(1)\n\n// 改后的做法：显示剩余数量。为 0 时系统会自动隐藏\nTab(\"动态\", systemImage: \"bell\") { … }.badge(unread.count)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// 原來的做法：一直掛著\nTab(\"動態\", systemImage: \"bell\") { … }.badge(1)\n\n// 改後的做法：顯示剩餘數量。為 0 時系統會自動隱藏\nTab(\"動態\", systemImage: \"bell\") { … }.badge(unread.count)"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// Как сделали: бейдж висит постоянно\nTab(\"Новости\", systemImage: \"bell\") { … }.badge(1)\n\n// Как исправили: число оставшихся. При 0 система сама скроет бейдж\nTab(\"Новости\", systemImage: \"bell\") { … }.badge(unread.count)"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// Antes: siempre puesta\nTab(\"Novedades\", systemImage: \"bell\") { … }.badge(1)\n\n// Después: la cantidad de lo que queda. Con 0 el sistema la oculta por ti\nTab(\"Novedades\", systemImage: \"bell\") { … }.badge(unread.count)"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// Vorher: immer angehängt\nTab(\"Neuigkeiten\", systemImage: \"bell\") { … }.badge(1)\n\n// Nachher: die Anzahl dessen, was übrig ist. Bei 0 blendet das System es aus\nTab(\"Neuigkeiten\", systemImage: \"bell\") { … }.badge(unread.count)"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// Avant : toujours attaché\nTab(\"Mises à jour\", systemImage: \"bell\") { … }.badge(1)\n\n// Après : le nombre de ce qui reste. À 0, le système le masque pour vous\nTab(\"Mises à jour\", systemImage: \"bell\") { … }.badge(unread.count)"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// Prima: sempre presente\nTab(\"Aggiornamenti\", systemImage: \"bell\") { … }.badge(1)\n\n// Dopo: il numero di ciò che resta. A 0 il sistema lo nasconde per te\nTab(\"Aggiornamenti\", systemImage: \"bell\") { … }.badge(unread.count)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "// 이렇게 했다 - 성격이 다른 셋이 한 캡슐\nToolbarItemGroup(placement: .topBarTrailing) {\n    Button(\"삭제\", systemImage: \"trash\") { … }\n    Button(\"정렬\", systemImage: \"arrow.up.arrow.down\") { … }\n    Button(\"격자\", systemImage: \"square.grid.2x2\") { … }\n}\n\n// 이렇게 고쳤다 - 도구는 왼쪽, 파괴적 액션은 메뉴 안\nToolbarItemGroup(placement: .topBarLeading) { 격자; 정렬 }\nToolbarItem(placement: .topBarTrailing) {\n    Menu(\"더보기\", systemImage: \"ellipsis\") {\n        Button(\"삭제\", systemImage: \"trash\", role: .destructive) { … }\n    }\n}": {
      "comment": "On-screen SwiftUI code sample. Translate only Korean comments and string literals; keep Swift code as is.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// Before: three different kinds of actions in one capsule\nToolbarItemGroup(placement: .topBarTrailing) {\n    Button(\"Delete\", systemImage: \"trash\") { … }\n    Button(\"Sort\", systemImage: \"arrow.up.arrow.down\") { … }\n    Button(\"Grid\", systemImage: \"square.grid.2x2\") { … }\n}\n\n// After: tools on the left, the destructive action inside a menu\nToolbarItemGroup(placement: .topBarLeading) { grid; sort }\nToolbarItem(placement: .topBarTrailing) {\n    Menu(\"More\", systemImage: \"ellipsis\") {\n        Button(\"Delete\", systemImage: \"trash\", role: .destructive) { … }\n    }\n}"
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// Before: three different kinds of actions in one capsule\nToolbarItemGroup(placement: .topBarTrailing) {\n    Button(\"Delete\", systemImage: \"trash\") { … }\n    Button(\"Sort\", systemImage: \"arrow.up.arrow.down\") { … }\n    Button(\"Grid\", systemImage: \"square.grid.2x2\") { … }\n}\n\n// After: tools on the left, the destructive action inside a menu\nToolbarItemGroup(placement: .topBarLeading) { grid; sort }\nToolbarItem(placement: .topBarTrailing) {\n    Menu(\"More\", systemImage: \"ellipsis\") {\n        Button(\"Delete\", systemImage: \"trash\", role: .destructive) { … }\n    }\n}"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// こうしていた: 性質の違う3つが1つのカプセルに\nToolbarItemGroup(placement: .topBarTrailing) {\n    Button(\"削除\", systemImage: \"trash\") { … }\n    Button(\"並べ替え\", systemImage: \"arrow.up.arrow.down\") { … }\n    Button(\"グリッド\", systemImage: \"square.grid.2x2\") { … }\n}\n\n// こう直した: ツールは左、破壊的なアクションはメニューの中\nToolbarItemGroup(placement: .topBarLeading) { grid; sort }\nToolbarItem(placement: .topBarTrailing) {\n    Menu(\"その他\", systemImage: \"ellipsis\") {\n        Button(\"削除\", systemImage: \"trash\", role: .destructive) { … }\n    }\n}"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// 이렇게 했다 - 성격이 다른 셋이 한 캡슐\nToolbarItemGroup(placement: .topBarTrailing) {\n    Button(\"삭제\", systemImage: \"trash\") { … }\n    Button(\"정렬\", systemImage: \"arrow.up.arrow.down\") { … }\n    Button(\"격자\", systemImage: \"square.grid.2x2\") { … }\n}\n\n// 이렇게 고쳤다 - 도구는 왼쪽, 파괴적 액션은 메뉴 안\nToolbarItemGroup(placement: .topBarLeading) { 격자; 정렬 }\nToolbarItem(placement: .topBarTrailing) {\n    Menu(\"더보기\", systemImage: \"ellipsis\") {\n        Button(\"삭제\", systemImage: \"trash\", role: .destructive) { … }\n    }\n}"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// 原来的做法：三个性质不同的操作在一个胶囊里\nToolbarItemGroup(placement: .topBarTrailing) {\n    Button(\"删除\", systemImage: \"trash\") { … }\n    Button(\"排序\", systemImage: \"arrow.up.arrow.down\") { … }\n    Button(\"网格\", systemImage: \"square.grid.2x2\") { … }\n}\n\n// 改后的做法：工具放左边，破坏性操作放进菜单\nToolbarItemGroup(placement: .topBarLeading) { 网格; 排序 }\nToolbarItem(placement: .topBarTrailing) {\n    Menu(\"更多\", systemImage: \"ellipsis\") {\n        Button(\"删除\", systemImage: \"trash\", role: .destructive) { … }\n    }\n}"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// 原來的做法：三個性質不同的操作在一個膠囊裡\nToolbarItemGroup(placement: .topBarTrailing) {\n    Button(\"刪除\", systemImage: \"trash\") { … }\n    Button(\"排序\", systemImage: \"arrow.up.arrow.down\") { … }\n    Button(\"網格\", systemImage: \"square.grid.2x2\") { … }\n}\n\n// 改後的做法：工具放左邊，破壞性操作放進選單\nToolbarItemGroup(placement: .topBarLeading) { 網格; 排序 }\nToolbarItem(placement: .topBarTrailing) {\n    Menu(\"更多\", systemImage: \"ellipsis\") {\n        Button(\"刪除\", systemImage: \"trash\", role: .destructive) { … }\n    }\n}"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// Как сделали: три разных по смыслу элемента в одной капсуле\nToolbarItemGroup(placement: .topBarTrailing) {\n    Button(\"Удалить\", systemImage: \"trash\") { … }\n    Button(\"Сортировка\", systemImage: \"arrow.up.arrow.down\") { … }\n    Button(\"Сетка\", systemImage: \"square.grid.2x2\") { … }\n}\n\n// Как исправили: инструменты слева, разрушительное действие внутри меню\nToolbarItemGroup(placement: .topBarLeading) { сетка; сортировка }\nToolbarItem(placement: .topBarTrailing) {\n    Menu(\"Ещё\", systemImage: \"ellipsis\") {\n        Button(\"Удалить\", systemImage: \"trash\", role: .destructive) { … }\n    }\n}"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// Antes: tres tipos distintos de acciones en una cápsula\nToolbarItemGroup(placement: .topBarTrailing) {\n    Button(\"Eliminar\", systemImage: \"trash\") { … }\n    Button(\"Ordenar\", systemImage: \"arrow.up.arrow.down\") { … }\n    Button(\"Cuadrícula\", systemImage: \"square.grid.2x2\") { … }\n}\n\n// Después: herramientas a la izquierda, la acción destructiva dentro de un menú\nToolbarItemGroup(placement: .topBarLeading) { grid; sort }\nToolbarItem(placement: .topBarTrailing) {\n    Menu(\"Más\", systemImage: \"ellipsis\") {\n        Button(\"Eliminar\", systemImage: \"trash\", role: .destructive) { … }\n    }\n}"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// Vorher: drei verschiedene Arten von Aktionen in einer Kapsel\nToolbarItemGroup(placement: .topBarTrailing) {\n    Button(\"Löschen\", systemImage: \"trash\") { … }\n    Button(\"Sortieren\", systemImage: \"arrow.up.arrow.down\") { … }\n    Button(\"Raster\", systemImage: \"square.grid.2x2\") { … }\n}\n\n// Nachher: Werkzeuge links, die destruktive Aktion in einem Menü\nToolbarItemGroup(placement: .topBarLeading) { grid; sort }\nToolbarItem(placement: .topBarTrailing) {\n    Menu(\"Mehr\", systemImage: \"ellipsis\") {\n        Button(\"Löschen\", systemImage: \"trash\", role: .destructive) { … }\n    }\n}"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// Avant : trois types d'actions différents dans une capsule\nToolbarItemGroup(placement: .topBarTrailing) {\n    Button(\"Supprimer\", systemImage: \"trash\") { … }\n    Button(\"Trier\", systemImage: \"arrow.up.arrow.down\") { … }\n    Button(\"Grille\", systemImage: \"square.grid.2x2\") { … }\n}\n\n// Après : les outils à gauche, l'action destructive dans un menu\nToolbarItemGroup(placement: .topBarLeading) { grid; sort }\nToolbarItem(placement: .topBarTrailing) {\n    Menu(\"Plus\", systemImage: \"ellipsis\") {\n        Button(\"Supprimer\", systemImage: \"trash\", role: .destructive) { … }\n    }\n}"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// Prima: tre tipi diversi di azioni in una capsula\nToolbarItemGroup(placement: .topBarTrailing) {\n    Button(\"Elimina\", systemImage: \"trash\") { … }\n    Button(\"Ordina\", systemImage: \"arrow.up.arrow.down\") { … }\n    Button(\"Griglia\", systemImage: \"square.grid.2x2\") { … }\n}\n\n// Dopo: gli strumenti a sinistra, l'azione distruttiva dentro un menu\nToolbarItemGroup(placement: .topBarLeading) { grid; sort }\nToolbarItem(placement: .topBarTrailing) {\n    Menu(\"Altro\", systemImage: \"ellipsis\") {\n        Button(\"Elimina\", systemImage: \"trash\", role: .destructive) { … }\n    }\n}"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "// 이렇게 했다 - 이동하지 않는 탭\nTab(\"작성\", systemImage: \"square.and.pencil\", value: 2) { EmptyView() }\n.onChange(of: selection) { if $1 == 2 { composing = true; selection = old } }\n\n// 이렇게 고쳤다 - 액션은 툴바로\n.toolbar {\n    ToolbarItem(placement: .bottomBar) {\n        Button(\"작성\", systemImage: \"square.and.pencil\") { composing = true }\n    }\n}": {
      "comment": "On-screen SwiftUI code sample. Translate only Korean comments and string literals; keep Swift code as is.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// Before: a tab that doesn't go anywhere\nTab(\"Compose\", systemImage: \"square.and.pencil\", value: 2) { EmptyView() }\n.onChange(of: selection) { if $1 == 2 { composing = true; selection = old } }\n\n// After: actions belong in the toolbar\n.toolbar {\n    ToolbarItem(placement: .bottomBar) {\n        Button(\"Compose\", systemImage: \"square.and.pencil\") { composing = true }\n    }\n}"
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// Before: a tab that doesn't go anywhere\nTab(\"Compose\", systemImage: \"square.and.pencil\", value: 2) { EmptyView() }\n.onChange(of: selection) { if $1 == 2 { composing = true; selection = old } }\n\n// After: actions belong in the toolbar\n.toolbar {\n    ToolbarItem(placement: .bottomBar) {\n        Button(\"Compose\", systemImage: \"square.and.pencil\") { composing = true }\n    }\n}"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// こうしていた: 移動しないタブ\nTab(\"作成\", systemImage: \"square.and.pencil\", value: 2) { EmptyView() }\n.onChange(of: selection) { if $1 == 2 { composing = true; selection = old } }\n\n// こう直した: アクションはツールバーへ\n.toolbar {\n    ToolbarItem(placement: .bottomBar) {\n        Button(\"作成\", systemImage: \"square.and.pencil\") { composing = true }\n    }\n}"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// 이렇게 했다 - 이동하지 않는 탭\nTab(\"작성\", systemImage: \"square.and.pencil\", value: 2) { EmptyView() }\n.onChange(of: selection) { if $1 == 2 { composing = true; selection = old } }\n\n// 이렇게 고쳤다 - 액션은 툴바로\n.toolbar {\n    ToolbarItem(placement: .bottomBar) {\n        Button(\"작성\", systemImage: \"square.and.pencil\") { composing = true }\n    }\n}"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// 原来的做法：不跳转的标签\nTab(\"撰写\", systemImage: \"square.and.pencil\", value: 2) { EmptyView() }\n.onChange(of: selection) { if $1 == 2 { composing = true; selection = old } }\n\n// 改后的做法：把操作放进工具栏\n.toolbar {\n    ToolbarItem(placement: .bottomBar) {\n        Button(\"撰写\", systemImage: \"square.and.pencil\") { composing = true }\n    }\n}"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// 原來的做法：不跳轉的標籤\nTab(\"撰寫\", systemImage: \"square.and.pencil\", value: 2) { EmptyView() }\n.onChange(of: selection) { if $1 == 2 { composing = true; selection = old } }\n\n// 改後的做法：把操作放進工具列\n.toolbar {\n    ToolbarItem(placement: .bottomBar) {\n        Button(\"撰寫\", systemImage: \"square.and.pencil\") { composing = true }\n    }\n}"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// Как сделали: вкладка, которая никуда не ведёт\nTab(\"Написать\", systemImage: \"square.and.pencil\", value: 2) { EmptyView() }\n.onChange(of: selection) { if $1 == 2 { composing = true; selection = old } }\n\n// Как исправили: действие переносим в панель инструментов\n.toolbar {\n    ToolbarItem(placement: .bottomBar) {\n        Button(\"Написать\", systemImage: \"square.and.pencil\") { composing = true }\n    }\n}"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// Antes: una pestaña que no lleva a ningún sitio\nTab(\"Redactar\", systemImage: \"square.and.pencil\", value: 2) { EmptyView() }\n.onChange(of: selection) { if $1 == 2 { composing = true; selection = old } }\n\n// Después: las acciones van en la barra de herramientas\n.toolbar {\n    ToolbarItem(placement: .bottomBar) {\n        Button(\"Redactar\", systemImage: \"square.and.pencil\") { composing = true }\n    }\n}"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// Vorher: ein Tab, der nirgendwohin führt\nTab(\"Verfassen\", systemImage: \"square.and.pencil\", value: 2) { EmptyView() }\n.onChange(of: selection) { if $1 == 2 { composing = true; selection = old } }\n\n// Nachher: Aktionen gehören in die Symbolleiste\n.toolbar {\n    ToolbarItem(placement: .bottomBar) {\n        Button(\"Verfassen\", systemImage: \"square.and.pencil\") { composing = true }\n    }\n}"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// Avant : un onglet qui ne mène nulle part\nTab(\"Rédiger\", systemImage: \"square.and.pencil\", value: 2) { EmptyView() }\n.onChange(of: selection) { if $1 == 2 { composing = true; selection = old } }\n\n// Après : les actions ont leur place dans la barre d'outils\n.toolbar {\n    ToolbarItem(placement: .bottomBar) {\n        Button(\"Rédiger\", systemImage: \"square.and.pencil\") { composing = true }\n    }\n}"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// Prima: una scheda che non porta da nessuna parte\nTab(\"Scrivi\", systemImage: \"square.and.pencil\", value: 2) { EmptyView() }\n.onChange(of: selection) { if $1 == 2 { composing = true; selection = old } }\n\n// Dopo: le azioni stanno nella barra degli strumenti\n.toolbar {\n    ToolbarItem(placement: .bottomBar) {\n        Button(\"Scrivi\", systemImage: \"square.and.pencil\") { composing = true }\n    }\n}"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "// 큰 자리: 스크롤 콘텐츠 맨 위의 커스텀 헤더\n// 작은 자리: principal 에 같은 정보를 압축해 넣는다\n.toolbar {\n    ToolbarItem(placement: .principal) {\n        HStack(spacing: 6) { Avatar(); Text(name).bold() }\n    }\n}\n.toolbarTitleDisplayMode(.inline)": {
      "comment": "On-screen SwiftUI code sample. Translate only Korean comments and string literals; keep Swift code as is.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// Big spot: a custom header at the top of the scroll content\n// Small spot: compress the same info into principal\n.toolbar {\n    ToolbarItem(placement: .principal) {\n        HStack(spacing: 6) { Avatar(); Text(name).bold() }\n    }\n}\n.toolbarTitleDisplayMode(.inline)"
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// Big spot: a custom header at the top of the scroll content\n// Small spot: compress the same info into principal\n.toolbar {\n    ToolbarItem(placement: .principal) {\n        HStack(spacing: 6) { Avatar(); Text(name).bold() }\n    }\n}\n.toolbarTitleDisplayMode(.inline)"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// 大きな場所: スクロールコンテンツ最上部のカスタムヘッダー\n// 小さな場所: 同じ情報を principal に凝縮して入れる\n.toolbar {\n    ToolbarItem(placement: .principal) {\n        HStack(spacing: 6) { Avatar(); Text(name).bold() }\n    }\n}\n.toolbarTitleDisplayMode(.inline)"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// 큰 자리: 스크롤 콘텐츠 맨 위의 커스텀 헤더\n// 작은 자리: principal 에 같은 정보를 압축해 넣는다\n.toolbar {\n    ToolbarItem(placement: .principal) {\n        HStack(spacing: 6) { Avatar(); Text(name).bold() }\n    }\n}\n.toolbarTitleDisplayMode(.inline)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// 大位置：滚动内容最上方的自定义标题区\n// 小位置：把同样的信息压缩后放进 principal\n.toolbar {\n    ToolbarItem(placement: .principal) {\n        HStack(spacing: 6) { Avatar(); Text(name).bold() }\n    }\n}\n.toolbarTitleDisplayMode(.inline)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// 大位置：滾動內容最上方的自定義標題區\n// 小位置：把同樣的資訊壓縮後放進 principal\n.toolbar {\n    ToolbarItem(placement: .principal) {\n        HStack(spacing: 6) { Avatar(); Text(name).bold() }\n    }\n}\n.toolbarTitleDisplayMode(.inline)"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// Большое место: пользовательский заголовок в самом верху прокручиваемого контента\n// Малое место: те же данные сжато кладём в principal\n.toolbar {\n    ToolbarItem(placement: .principal) {\n        HStack(spacing: 6) { Avatar(); Text(name).bold() }\n    }\n}\n.toolbarTitleDisplayMode(.inline)"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// Sitio grande: un encabezado personalizado al principio del contenido desplazable\n// Sitio pequeño: comprime la misma información en principal\n.toolbar {\n    ToolbarItem(placement: .principal) {\n        HStack(spacing: 6) { Avatar(); Text(name).bold() }\n    }\n}\n.toolbarTitleDisplayMode(.inline)"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// Großer Platz: ein eigener Kopfbereich oben im scrollbaren Inhalt\n// Kleiner Platz: dieselben Infos verdichtet in principal\n.toolbar {\n    ToolbarItem(placement: .principal) {\n        HStack(spacing: 6) { Avatar(); Text(name).bold() }\n    }\n}\n.toolbarTitleDisplayMode(.inline)"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// Grand emplacement : un en-tête personnalisé en haut du contenu défilant\n// Petit emplacement : comprimez les mêmes informations dans principal\n.toolbar {\n    ToolbarItem(placement: .principal) {\n        HStack(spacing: 6) { Avatar(); Text(name).bold() }\n    }\n}\n.toolbarTitleDisplayMode(.inline)"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "// Posto grande: un'intestazione personalizzata in cima al contenuto scorrevole\n// Posto piccolo: comprimi le stesse informazioni in principal\n.toolbar {\n    ToolbarItem(placement: .principal) {\n        HStack(spacing: 6) { Avatar(); Text(name).bold() }\n    }\n}\n.toolbarTitleDisplayMode(.inline)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "0.3도 시스템이 허용하므로 문제없다": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The system allows even 0.3, so it's fine"
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The system allows even 0.3, so it's fine"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "0.3でもシステムが許容するので問題ない"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "0.3도 시스템이 허용하므로 문제없다"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "0.3 系统也允许，所以没问题"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "0.3 系統也允許，所以沒問題"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "0,3 система тоже допускает, так что проблемы нет"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El sistema admite incluso 0,3, así que no pasa nada"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das System erlaubt sogar 0,3, also ist es in Ordnung"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le système autorise même 0,3, donc ce n'est pas grave"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il sistema permette perfino 0,3, quindi va bene"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "0이 되면 배지가 사라집니다, 배지는 \"처리할 것이 남았다\"는 뜻이지 장식이 아닙니다.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "At 0 the badge disappears. A badge means \"something is still left to handle,\" not decoration."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "At 0 the badge disappears. A badge means \"something is still left to handle,\" not decoration."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "0になるとバッジは消えます。バッジは「まだ処理すべきものが残っている」という意味で、飾りではありません。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "0이 되면 배지가 사라집니다, 배지는 \"처리할 것이 남았다\"는 뜻이지 장식이 아닙니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "变成 0 时角标就会消失。角标的意思是“还有待处理的事”，而不是装饰。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "變成 0 時標記就會消失。標記的意思是「還有待處理的事」，而不是裝飾。"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "При значении 0 бейдж исчезает. Бейдж означает «осталось, что обработать», а не украшение."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Con 0 la insignia desaparece. Una insignia significa «aún queda algo por atender», no es decoración."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bei 0 verschwindet das Badge. Ein Badge bedeutet „es ist noch etwas zu erledigen“, nicht Dekoration."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "À 0, le badge disparaît. Un badge signifie « il reste quelque chose à traiter », ce n'est pas de la décoration."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A 0 il badge scompare. Un badge significa «c'è ancora qualcosa da gestire», non è una decorazione."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1.1.5(principal)와 같은 자리 문법입니다. 자리가 곧 선언입니다.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It's the same placement grammar as 1.1.5 (principal). The placement itself is the declaration."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It's the same placement grammar as 1.1.5 (principal). The placement itself is the declaration."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1.1.5（principal）と同じ位置の文法です。位置そのものが宣言です。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1.1.5(principal)와 같은 자리 문법입니다. 자리가 곧 선언입니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "和 1.1.5（principal）是同样的位置语法。位置本身就是声明。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "和 1.1.5（principal）是同樣的位置語法。位置本身就是宣告。"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Та же грамматика места, что у 1.1.5 (principal). Место и есть объявление."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es la misma gramática de colocación que en 1.1.5 (principal). La colocación en sí es la declaración."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es ist dieselbe Platzierungsgrammatik wie 1.1.5 (principal). Die Platzierung selbst ist die Erklärung."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "C'est la même grammaire de placement que 1.1.5 (principal). Le placement lui-même est la déclaration."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "È la stessa grammatica di posizionamento di 1.1.5 (principal). La posizione stessa è la dichiarazione."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1.2.1(Large)과 번갈아 열어 같은 동작에서 무엇이 다른지 비교해 보세요.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Switch back and forth with 1.2.1 (Large) to compare what changes under the same action."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Switch back and forth with 1.2.1 (Large) to compare what changes under the same action."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1.2.1（Large）と交互に開いて、同じ操作で何が違うのか比べてみてください。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1.2.1(Large)과 번갈아 열어 같은 동작에서 무엇이 다른지 비교해 보세요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "和 1.2.1（Large）交替打开，比较同样的操作有什么不同。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "和 1.2.1（Large）交替開啟，比較同樣的操作有什麼不同。"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Открывайте поочерёдно с 1.2.1 (Large) и сравнивайте, чем отличается то же самое действие."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alterna con 1.2.1 (Large) para comparar qué cambia con la misma acción."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wechsle zwischen 1.2.1 (Large) hin und her, um zu vergleichen, was sich bei derselben Aktion ändert."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alternez avec 1.2.1 (Large) pour comparer ce qui change avec la même action."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alterna con 1.2.1 (Large) per confrontare cosa cambia con la stessa azione."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1.3.1(Soft)과 번갈아 열어 같은 배경에서 비교해 보세요.": {
      "localizations": {
